# Spotify Data Analyst Project

A practical end-to-end data analytics project for Spotify listening behavior using PostgreSQL, SQL, Python, and AI workflows.

## Project goal
Analyze user listening patterns, top songs, artist performance, and engagement trends from Spotify-style data using:
- PostgreSQL for storage and querying
- SQL for analytics and transformation
- Python for data cleaning and pipeline steps
- AI workflow for summarizing insights

